# Headers for every file the host serves from this folder: pages, styles,
# scripts, images and fonts.
#
# "no-transform" asks Cloudflare to deliver each file as it is written. Without
# it, Cloudflare's Web Analytics adds a statistics script of its own to every
# page, for every visitor, before anyone has said yes. That would make the cookie
# banner untrue. The statistics script is loaded by consent.js instead, and only
# after the visitor chooses Accept.
#
# The rest of the line is the caching Cloudflare gives files by default. It is
# repeated here because a header in this file takes the place of the default.
#
# See https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/get-started/
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform
